TITLE Pyrite oxidation with O2 fixed (log PO2=-0.7) via pe constraint; allow Goethite+Gypsum precipitation; SI Hematite
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    pe 0
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g) -0.7
    Pyrite 0 0.1
    Goethite 0 0
    Gypsum 0 0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected2.out
    -reset false
    -si Hematite
END
